xl-Big Baddy folder icons: an 80s school binder with racing stripes, designed
by xl_cheese for xl-Cheeselooks and drawn by tools/make-xl-binder.py.

The pictures on the binders (home, documents, music...) are Mint-Y's
(https://github.com/linuxmint/mint-y-icons), CC BY-SA 4.0, by Sam Hewitt and
Alexey Varfolomeev; the Desktop monitor is our own.

As they carry Mint-Y's pictures, these icons are shared under the same licence:
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
